# ============================================================
#  Git 忽略规则清单 (.gitignore)
#  严禁将庞大的二进制文件、大模型、编译库及日志提交到 Git 仓库中
# ============================================================

# 1. 大模型与权重文件
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.onnx

# 2. 二进制可执行文件与动态链接库
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.pyd

# 3. 日志与运行时临时文件
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
temp_*.txt
*.lnk

# 4. Python 编译缓存
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# 5. Node.js 依赖与各 IDE 隐藏配置
node_modules/
.vscode/
.atomcode/
.reasonix/
.trae/
.workbuddy/

# 6. 动态变化的数据账本与本地数据库
token_billing_stats.json
miracle_api_stats.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# 7. 临时工作区与旧版评测脚本
scratch/
scan_*.txt
verify_*.txt
*.tmp
bench_results/
benchmarks/
archive_deprecated/
docs/
tools/
mcp/
locate-anything/
启动*测速.bat
启动AI智能任务自适应网关.bat
AI启动器端口8081网页服务.bat
chat_template.jinja
chat_template_oneline.txt
anytxt_mcp.py
LICENSE*
AGENTS.md
